  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Fellows Award: Cultural &amp; Artistic Responses to Environmental Crisis 2025</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">9 individuals received a Fellows Award Cultural and Artistic Responses to Environmental Change. Through the programme, Prince Claus Fellowship Award was granted to potential leaders active at the cross-section between arts and culture and environmentalism. All work supported through this fellowship therefore contributes to Sustainable Development Goal 13: Climate Action, while specific projects address themes connected to more SDGs.</narrative>
